nd your straggler friends.<br>You can also play with your fellow rabbits by giving them carrots that you pick up on stage, and they can switch places with the pink rabbit.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341900/extras/48a1e118663447a1d40f2db3d7cd1abc.poster.avif?t=1730099778\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341900/extras/48a1e118663447a1d40f2db3d7cd1abc.webm?t=1730099778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341900/extras/48a1e118663447a1d40f2db3d7cd1abc.mp4?t=1730099778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
